# Zero-config mode
# No environment variables are required to open the Control Room or connect ChatGPT / Codex.
#
# Optional GitHub integration
# Add these only if you want GitHub OAuth, GitHub Copilot, private repositories,
# automatic branch push, or Pull Request creation.
#
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# SESSION_SECRET=
#
# SESSION_SECRET must be at least 32 characters when GitHub OAuth is enabled.
# ChatGPT / Codex uses Sign in with ChatGPT through Codex device authorization.
# No OPENAI_API_KEY or ChatGPT token is required in Vercel.
